# Bahasa UI + copy singkat

## Visual first (hard rule)

- Prefer **icons / symbols** over words for toggles, actions, and empty affordances.
- Visible text only when an icon alone is ambiguous; keep it **1–2 words**.
- No instructional sentences (`Ctrl+V di sini`, `Pilih file lalu...`).
- Use `aria-label` / `title` for accessibility; do not duplicate long copy on screen.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button>Upload file gambar</button>
<span>Ctrl+V di sini untuk paste</span>

// ✅ GOOD
<button aria-label="Upload"><Upload size={14} /></button>
<button aria-label="Paste"><ClipboardPaste size={14} /></button>
```

## Copy length (hard rule)

- **No long descriptions** under fields, tools, or empty states.
- Labels = **1–3 words** max (`Harga`, `Platform`, `Affiliate link`).
- No parentheticals like `(Rp, bilangan bulat)`, `(deal saja)`, `(opsional)` in labels.
- Hints/helper paragraphs: **avoid**. Use `placeholder` if needed.
- Success/error: one short line (or icon-only state when clear).

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<label>Harga (Rp, bilangan bulat)</label>
<label>Platform (deal saja)</label>
<p>Tempel link produk lalu ketuk Ambil data. Mengisi judul...</p>

// ✅ GOOD
<label>Harga</label>
<label>Platform</label>
<input placeholder="https://shopee.co.id/..." />
```

## Bahasa (hybrid)

Write in Bahasa for short sentences, but keep familiar English UI terms:

- Menu, Dashboard, Home/Beranda, Sidebar, Footer
- Login/Masuk, Logout/Keluar, Sign Up/Daftar, Save/Simpan, Checkout
- Download (bukan Unduh), Upload (bukan Unggah), Search/Cari
- Export, Import, Filter, Sort/Urutkan, Draft, Preview, Reset
- Profile/Profil, Setting/Pengaturan, Password, Account/Akun, Role/Akses
- Cart/Keranjang, Pricing/Harga, Invoice, Payment Method, Voucher/Kupon
- Pending, Success, Failed, Feedback (badges OK in English)

Never use awkward calques (Arah Pilih, Panel Instrumen, Unduh, Impor, Penyaring, dll).
